In the Hall of Explorers at [TAR1356 Prospector Stormpike], [QA707 Ironband Wants You!] (710 XP, requires level 30: Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan - carried to chapter 35) [G74.6,11.7 Ironforge]
At [TAR3979 Librarian Mae Paledust] beside him, [QA1050 Mythology of the Titans] (3,550 XP, requires level 28: a book in the Scarlet Monastery Library - carried to chapter 34; the reward is the Explorers' League Commendation neck) [G75.0,12.5 Ironforge]
At [TAR5637 Roetten Stonehammer], [QA1453 Reclaimers' Business in Desolace] (1,300 XP, requires level 30: Kreldig Ungor in Desolace - carried to chapter 33) [G70.0,21.3 Ironforge]
[O]At [TAR6291 Balthus Stoneflayer] in the Great Forge, [T] learn Expert Skinning (50s) once Skinning is 125 (any level gate on Forever is unverified) [G39.9,32.5 Ironforge]
